  <data name="Ending_Cutscene_Line_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>[tmp]You win this round, but I'll be back.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You must be {0}...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What an unfortunate state of affairs this is...[br]My name is {0},[pause=0] leader of the {1}.[br]And we are the rightful owners of this island,[pause=0] inherited from the legendary guildmaster.[br]The land,[pause=0] the dungeons,[pause=0] and all their treasures...[br]They've been in our family's name for three generations.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_003" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>So what does that make you?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_004" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Tresspassers!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_005" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Outlaws!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_006" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>If that little cargo group wants to set up a supply route in my woods,[pause=0] they deserve to pay a tithe.[br]I expected a little fuss,[pause=0] but it was truly disrespectful for them to resort to this.[br]Smuggling goods through my routes,[pause=30] attacking my associates,[pause=30] and now a bounty...[br]{0}...[pause=0]\nYou've made a mistake in taking up their offer...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Line_007" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>So allow me to give you a better one...[pause=60]\nan offer you can't refuse!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Expo_Cutscene_Short" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>[tmp]I give a shortened acknowledgement of your return.</value>
